OL,3,GNEWSAGovernment intervenes on ditched
OL,4,Ahousing plan
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe government has told a council it
OL,7,Fmust continue with a local plan that
OL,8,Fincludes proposals for 40,000 new homes
OL,9,Fdespite it being rejected.
OL,11,FWest Northamptonshire Council's Local
OL,12,FPlan was discussed and dismissed by the
OL,13,Fthree Reform UK cabinet members on the
OL,14,FPlanning Policy Committee on Monday.
OL,16,FOn Tuesday, the government's housing
OL,17,Fminister, Matthew Pennycook, told the
OL,18,Fauthority it must continue with the
OL,19,Fexisting plan.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
